    "problem": "Calculate ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }(4{x}^{2}-5x+16).$",
    "worked_solution": "We identify the leading term and compute its limit:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }(4{x}^{2}-5x+16) & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }(4{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot {lim}_{x\\to \\infty }({x}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\infty \\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
